	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t01r0101_mama_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら　おかえり▼
さがしていた　おともだちに　あえたの？
たしか　Nって　なまえの……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T03:41:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら　おかえり▼
探していた　お友達に　会えたの？
たしか　Nって　名前の……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T04:10:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・上を向いたままメッセージ表示
・続けて
※swanで変更</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T03:41:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>前作主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T03:37:12" />
