	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t01r0101_mama_09a"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ママ『うん　ばっちり！▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]も　ポケモンも
げんき　ハツラツって　かんじ！▼
さあ　たびを　つづけなさいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ママ『うん　ばっちり！▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]も　ポケモンも
元気ハツラツって　感じ！▼
さあ　旅を　続けなさいな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
